      "docs": "Compute the SDF enclosing the given bounds, with a 'safe' buffer zone\n@param Bounds Bounding box for the mesh data (passed as param it is usually already available, depending on TriangleMeshType and whether an AABB tree was provided)\n@return false if cancelled or failed (e.g. due to invalid arguments); true otherwise"
